  "prefLabel": "Ac 400 CONTINUED STATUS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Ac 400 CONTINUED STATUS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14322, effective 9-15-25, adopted, readopted, readopted with amendment, or repealed all of the rules in Chapter Ac 400 titled “Continued Status.” Document #14322 also deleted the number Ac 404.04 which had previously been reserved after rule Ac 404.04 titled “Claims Against Licensees” had been repealed by Document #10054, effective 1-1-12. Document #14322 replaces all prior filings affecting the former rules in Chapter Ac 400.\n\nThe following rules were repealed by Document #14322:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ac100-500.html"
